{"seq":10,"slug":"ai-usage-metering-entitlements","title":"AI 用量计量与权益控制","stage":"DONE","category":"indie-app-shipping","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements","rating":{"composite":4,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# AI 用量计量与权益控制 简介\n\nAI 产品把模型调用、工具执行和工作流步骤变成了高频且成本差异巨大的消费行为；如果只把这些行为写进分析系统，产品仍然无法可靠回答“谁用了多少、现在还能不能用、最终该收多少钱”。本 hub 面向正在构建商业化 AI 产品的后端工程师、平台工程师和技术负责人，目标是把用量事实、价格解释、权益判断与账单交付组织成一条可审计、可重放、可演进的控制面。\n\n本 hub 与兄弟主题有清晰边界。[订阅定价与计费](../04_subscription-pricing-billing/_INTRODUCTION.md)侧重商业模式、支付与订阅体验；[独立产品的数据分析](../08_indie-product-analytics/_INTRODUCTION.md)侧重产品决策指标；[AI 产品发现与验证](../09_ai-product-discovery-validation/_INTRODUCTION.md)侧重需求证据。这里不重复它们，而是专门处理会影响访问权和金额的工程事实：事件身份、计量账本、聚合窗口、价格快照、额度预留、信用余额、账单对账以及故障恢复。\n\n前置知识包括 HTTP API、关系数据库事务、消息队列的至少一次投递、订阅周期与发票的基本概念。读者不需要先使用某个计费供应商；文中以 CloudEvents、Stripe、OpenMeter、OpenFeature 和 Google SRE 的一手资料校准术语，再将其抽象为供应商无关的领域模型。\n\n第一章“用量事件与账本”从事实入口开始，解释稳定事件模式、低基数与高基数维度、幂等键、去重边界和只追加计量账本。它回答系统最基础的问题：收到重试、乱序或重复数据时，怎样仍然只承认一次真实消费。\n\n第二章“聚合与价格”把事实变成可解释的量：事件时间与处理时间如何分工，滚动窗口与账期怎样封口，为什么价格计划必须按版本快照，以及迟到与更正事件怎样通过补偿和对账收敛。\n\n第三章“权益与信用”处理在线决策：布尔权益、数量权益和计量权益如何统一表达，硬限额与软限额如何选择，怎样用额度预留抵抗并发超卖，以及预付信用、宽限和超额消费如何形成明确策略。\n\n第四章“账单与运营”划定计量系统与外部账单系统的责任边界，并建立审计、服务级目标、可观测性、测试、迁移与故障演练。这里强调金额正确性不等于请求成功率，业务正确性必须成为独立的服务指标。\n\n推荐学习路径按角色区分。第一次搭建计量系统的工程师依次阅读第一至第四章，先稳定事实再开放收费；已有计费供应商集成的团队可先读第四章，画清所有权后回到第二章修复价格与对账；负责在线限流的工程师可先读第三章，再用第一章的账本与幂等模型补足可恢复性；负责财务或收入平台的工程师应重点串联第二章第三节与第四章第一节。\n\n全 hub 采用三个贯穿原则：原始事实不可被汇总替代，任何会影响金额或访问权的规则都要版本化，所有跨边界写入都要拥有可重复执行的身份和对账入口。这样即使供应商、价格或产品包发生破坏性变更，历史账单仍可解释，新流量也能安全迁移。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"usage-events-and-ledger","title":"用量事件与账本","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/usage-events-and-ledger","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"usage-event-schema","title":"用量事件模式与维度契约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/usage-events-and-ledger/usage-event-schema"},{"seq":2,"slug":"idempotency-and-deduplication","title":"幂等、去重与重放安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/usage-events-and-ledger/idempotency-and-deduplication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"append-only-metering-ledger","title":"只追加计量账本与证据链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/usage-events-and-ledger/append-only-metering-ledger"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"aggregation-and-pricing","title":"聚合与价格","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/aggregation-and-pricing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aggregation-windows-and-event-time","title":"聚合窗口、事件时间与最终性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/aggregation-and-pricing/aggregation-windows-and-event-time"},{"seq":2,"slug":"immutable-pricing-plan-snapshots","title":"不可变价格计划与订阅快照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/aggregation-and-pricing/immutable-pricing-plan-snapshots"},{"seq":3,"slug":"late-events-corrections-reconciliation","title":"迟到事件、更正与对账收敛","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/aggregation-and-pricing/late-events-corrections-reconciliation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"entitlements-and-credits","title":"权益与信用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/entitlements-and-credits","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"entitlement-policy-decisions","title":"权益模型与策略决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/entitlements-and-credits/entitlement-policy-decisions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quotas-reservations-and-concurrency","title":"配额、预留与并发一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/entitlements-and-credits/quotas-reservations-and-concurrency"},{"seq":3,"slug":"prepaid-credits-grace-and-overage","title":"预付信用、宽限与超额策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/entitlements-and-credits/prepaid-credits-grace-and-overage"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"billing-and-operations","title":"账单与运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/billing-and-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"invoice-and-billing-boundary","title":"发票交付与计费系统边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/billing-and-operations/invoice-and-billing-boundary"},{"seq":2,"slug":"audit-slos-and-observability","title":"审计、SLO 与业务可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/billing-and-operations/audit-slos-and-observability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-migrations-and-failure-drills","title":"测试、迁移与故障演练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/billing-and-operations/testing-migrations-and-failure-drills"}]}]}